\begin{Example}


For a deterministic income stream, for example,  $e _t = 1$, $t\geq 0$, the indifference value does not change under extra information. \tcb{Its indifference value is $\frac 1r$ under both the choice of parameters in Section \ref{secKnowsTimes} and under the choice of parameters in Section \ref{secKnowsSize}}.
