\subsection{\texorpdfstring{Simple $ U_{r,s}^+(B_2) $-modules of type $ \mathcal{M}(\epsilon) $}{}} Let $ \epsilon = (\epsilon_1, \epsilon_2, \epsilon_3) \in (\mathbb{C}^*)^3 $. 
