    \includegraphics[width=0.45\linewidth]{pics/extension_af.png}

    \footnotesize \justifying On the left: a marketer samples and learns from averages over ranges $[\underline{X_q}, \overline{X_q}]$ instead of points. On the right: the goal is to find regions where the treatment effects are positive or negative and not to find the maximum.
