After considering the static case, the natural step is to introduce mobility, and we do that with the set $\mathbf{a_M}$, generating the Q-table:
\begin{equation}
\mathbf{Q_M} = \ \begin{blockarray}{ c c c}
\begin{block}{[ c c c]}
