4 \mathcal S_1 + \Big(2 \mathcal D_2^{(\geq 2)}  + \sum_{k=3}^{21} k\, \mathcal S_2^{(k)} \Big) +  \Big(2 \mathcal D_3^{(\geq 2)} +  \sum_{k=2}^{22} k\, \mathcal S_3^{(k)} \Big)  \leq 336\,.
