\right\}
$$
which acts by gluing around the boundary and resolving in the usual way using semisimplicity.
One shows that
$$
\Tube_\cC(\partial\Lambda) \cong \End_{Z(\cC)}(\Tr(X^{\partial \Lambda}).
$$

